    'Combine with +, several in a row with commas. Ctrl, Shift, Alt, Win (Cmd on a Mac), letters, digits, F1–F24, enter, tab, esc, space, arrows, home, end, pageup, pagedown, delete, media keys (volumeup, playpause…).': 'Соединяйте через +, несколько подряд — через запятую. Ctrl, Shift, Alt, Win (Cmd на Mac), буквы, цифры, F1–F24, enter, tab, esc, space, стрелки, home, end, pageup, pagedown, delete, медиаклавиши (volumeup, playpause…).',
